The diagram shows the visible spectrum of a solution of $[\text{V}(\text{H}_2\text{O})_6]^{3+}$.

{{figure:pdf_visual_02.png}}

State and explain what colour the solution is.

The complex $[\text{V}(\text{H}_2\text{O})_6]^{3+}$ also reacts with ethane-1,2-diamine ($\text{en}$), $\text{H}_2\text{NCH}_2\text{CH}_2\text{NH}_2$, to form a mixture of isomeric octahedral complexes.

$$[\text{V}(\text{H}_2\text{O})_6]^{3+} + 3\text{en} \rightleftharpoons [\text{V}(\text{en})_3]^{3+} + 6\text{H}_2\text{O}$$

Complete the three-dimensional diagrams to show the **two** isomers of $[\text{V}(\text{en})_3]^{3+}$.

{{figure:pdf_visual_04.png}}

{{figure:pdf_visual_05.png}}

You may use N-N to represent $\text{en}$.
